<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 6,694 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 116.88 pence a kilo against 116.63 last week and 113.90 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 13,730 pkgs sold so far this year is 116.75 pence against 112.96 pence for the 15,741 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
